   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) sensibilisation accrue &#xe0; la question de l&#x2019;&#xe9;galit&#xe9; des genres dans les forces arm&#xe9;es ghan&#xe9;ennes; 2) capacit&#xe9;s accrues des instituions &#xe0; int&#xe9;grer la question de l&#x2019;&#xe9;galit&#xe9; des genres &#xe0; l&#x2019;ensemble des forces arm&#xe9;es ghan&#xe9;ennes; 3) capacit&#xe9;s de maintien de la paix renforc&#xe9;es des forces arm&#xe9;es ghan&#xe9;ennes.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) strengthened awareness of gender in the Ghana armed forces; (2) increased institutional capacity to mainstream gender throughout the Ghana armed forces; and (3) strengthened peacekeeping capacity of the Ghana armed forces.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
